            "id": "burning-lore",
            "name": "Burning Lore",
            "text": "Word Bearers Models may gain the Psyker Trait and a specific Psychic Discipline. Any Model with the High Command Battlefield Role and Word Bearers Trait may be given the Psyker Trait and the Anathemata Psychic Discipline for +40 Points per Model."
        }
